/* Sheets */

"Clone Before Slimming?" = "瘦身前先克隆？";
"We recommend making a clone before applying a service profile, so your current apps, data, settings, and simulator state remain available if anything unexpected happens." = "建议在应用服务配置前先创建克隆，这样即使出现意外，你当前的应用、数据、设置和模拟器状态仍然可用。";
"Backup or general-purpose simulator" = "备份或日常用途的模拟器";
"The clone keeps the same apps, data, settings, and current service profile. SimSlim rebuilds simulator-local links and registrations so it is ready for separate use as a point-in-time backup or development simulator." = "克隆会保留相同的应用、数据、设置和当前服务配置。SimSlim 会重建模拟器本地链接和注册信息，使其可作为时间点备份或开发模拟器独立使用。";
"To create backups for multiple selections, clone each simulator from its row menu or select one simulator at a time in the toolbar." = "要为多个选择创建备份，请从每行的菜单克隆各模拟器，或在工具栏中一次只选择一个模拟器。";
"Continue Without Clone" = "不克隆，继续";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"OK" = "好";

"Simulator name" = "模拟器名称";
"Name" = "名称";
"Clone Simulator" = "克隆模拟器";
"Rename Simulator" = "重命名模拟器";
"%@ Copy" = "%@ 副本";

"Renaming changes only the simulator’s display name. Its apps, data, runtime, and service profile stay the same." = "重命名只会更改模拟器的显示名称。其应用、数据、运行时和服务配置保持不变。";
"The clone copies the source simulator’s apps, data, settings, and current SimSlim service profile. SimSlim rebases simulator-local links, rebuilds generated app registrations, and audits the running clone for open paths into the source. SimSlim may briefly boot a shutdown source to read its profile, or briefly shut down a booted source to make the copy. The source returns to its original boot state, and the clone finishes shutdown." = "克隆会复制源模拟器的应用、数据、设置和当前 SimSlim 服务配置。SimSlim 会重定模拟器本地链接的基准、重建生成的应用注册，并审计运行中的克隆是否存在指向源模拟器的打开路径。SimSlim 可能会短暂启动处于关机状态的源模拟器以读取其配置，或短暂关闭已启动的源模拟器以完成复制。源模拟器会回到原始启动状态，克隆完成后处于关机状态。";

"Erase %d %@" = "抹掉 %d 个%@？";
"Delete %d %@" = "删除 %d 个%@？";
"All apps, data, settings, and service-slimming overrides will be removed. The simulator devices remain available, reset to stock, and shutdown. This cannot be undone." = "所有应用、数据、设置和服务瘦身覆盖将被移除。模拟器设备仍可使用，恢复原厂状态并关机。此操作无法撤销。";
"The selected simulator devices and all of their apps, data, and settings will be permanently removed. This cannot be undone." = "所选模拟器设备及其所有应用、数据和设置将被永久移除。此操作无法撤销。";
"Booted simulators will be shut down first." = "已启动的模拟器将先被关闭。";
"Calculating…" = "正在计算…";

"Permanently Clean %d Simulator%@" = "永久清理 %d 个模拟器%@？";
"Approximately %@ will be removed immediately, not moved to Trash. Generated data stays deleted; on-demand language data can be downloaded again by iOS." = "约 %@ 将被立即移除，而不会移入废纸篓。生成的数据将保持删除；按需语言数据可由 iOS 重新下载。";
"Recommended: clone before cleaning" = "建议：清理前先克隆";
"A clone preserves the simulator’s current apps, data, settings, and service profile before this permanent cleanup. It can be kept as a backup or used as a normal simulator." = "在此永久清理之前，克隆会保留模拟器当前的应用、数据、设置和服务配置。它可作为备份保留，也可作为普通模拟器使用。";
"Clone Simulator First" = "先克隆模拟器";
"Clone each selected simulator individually from its row menu or the toolbar before continuing." = "继续之前，请从每行的菜单或工具栏逐个克隆所选的模拟器。";
"Erase is not an undo for cleanup data" = "抹掉不是清理数据的撤销操作";
"Deleted caches, logs, and temporary history do not come back. Downloaded language data may return when a feature needs it. Erase is only a way to create a usable fresh simulator if cleanup causes trouble; it also removes every remaining app, setting, and user-data container." = "已删除的缓存、日志和临时历史不会恢复。已下载的语言数据可能在功能需要时重新出现。抹掉只是在清理引发问题时创建可用全新模拟器的一种方式；它还会移除所有剩余的应用、设置和用户数据容器。";
"Type CLEAN to continue" = "输入 CLEAN 以继续";
"CLEAN" = "CLEAN";
"Clean Disk Data" = "清理磁盘数据";

